# Personal Repository Leak Gate

This is a public personal repository.

Before every commit, push, release, or publication:

1. Read and follow `~/.cursor/skills/personal-repo-leak-scan/SKILL.md`.
2. Run:
   `bash ~/.cursor/skills/personal-repo-leak-scan/scripts/scan.sh "$PWD"`
3. Review every non-zero result. Stop on confirmed internal data or secrets; document legitimate public references as false positives.
4. Verify generated lockfiles contain no internal registries, corporate hostnames, or private package URLs.
5. Use the public npm registry for lockfiles committed to this repository.

Do not bypass this gate because application tests pass; tests do not detect information leaks.
